  `unregistervm UUID --delete` only if its settings and storage paths are under `runtime.storage_root`
  or are proven by a valid cleanup manifest; otherwise unregister without `--delete`
  and report the external files as preserved. Capture command failures per VM instead
  of aborting the full sweep. Add a file-purpose header comment. Edit only this file.'

